{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "ax10a906guxme9nh", "title": "商品秒杀巧用Redis与Lua预防库存超卖~", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"v8NRP\" id=\"v8NRP\"><span data-lake-id=\"u69edd9a6\" id=\"u69edd9a6\">方案分析</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uf9649261\" id=\"uf9649261\"><span data-lake-id=\"uea5510c6\" id=\"uea5510c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">在高并发秒杀场景下，库存超卖的主要原因是：</span></p><ol list=\"uc6ff7883\"><li fid=\"uef2849c6\" data-lake-id=\"ub6870e8c\" id=\"ub6870e8c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc6141b8f\" id=\"uc6141b8f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">多个并发请求同时操作库存，导致库存变负或超卖。</span></li><li fid=\"uef2849c6\" data-lake-id=\"ucb14afdd\" id=\"ucb14afdd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d597b51\" id=\"u7d597b51\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">数据库性能瓶颈无法快速响应大量请求。</span></li></ol><h1 data-lake-id=\"UKsuq\" id=\"UKsuq\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec900fec\" id=\"uec900fec\">Redis+Lua解决方案</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u01275540\" id=\"u01275540\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77d42250\" id=\"u77d42250\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">Redis是单线程的，结合Lua脚本可以保证对库存的操作是原子的，避免并发问题。</span></p><ul list=\"u91cc02e2\"><li fid=\"u26192566\" data-lake-id=\"ud7d1f177\" id=\"ud7d1f177\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u10ec3e0d\" id=\"u10ec3e0d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">Redis的优势</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1bddb4bc\" id=\"u1bddb4bc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：高并发、高性能、支持丰富的数据结构。</span></li><li fid=\"u26192566\" data-lake-id=\"u6db8fa8c\" id=\"u6db8fa8c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubbc3e115\" id=\"ubbc3e115\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">Lua的优势</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u65549151\" id=\"u65549151\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：运行在Redis中，</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua3f62a0e\" id=\"ua3f62a0e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">可以在一个原子操作中完成多条命令</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2730b292\" id=\"u2730b292\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">。</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id=\"MwoqR\" id=\"MwoqR\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07e08d85\" id=\"u07e08d85\">核心思路</span></h1><ul list=\"u833b8509\"><li fid=\"u37f9847c\" data-lake-id=\"u5a4fd901\" id=\"u5a4fd901\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4614b00a\" id=\"u4614b00a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">商品秒杀前，将商品的库存预先加载到Redis中。</span></li><li fid=\"u37f9847c\" data-lake-id=\"ud1e9eb83\" id=\"ud1e9eb83\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7fae3326\" id=\"u7fae3326\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">使用Lua脚本对库存进行扣减操作，确保每个请求的库存操作是</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u44708f94\" id=\"u44708f94\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">原子</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4c3fddec\" id=\"u4c3fddec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">的。</span></li><li fid=\"u37f9847c\" data-lake-id=\"u00f31178\" id=\"u00f31178\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3285743\" id=\"uf3285743\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">Lua脚本校验库存是否足够，如果足够则扣减库存并返回秒杀成功；否则返回秒杀失败。</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id=\"smFjI\" id=\"smFjI\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub41907ee\" id=\"ub41907ee\">Lua脚本实现库存扣减</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lua%5Cn%5Cn--%20Lua%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%A3%E5%87%8F%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%5Cnlocal%20stock_key%20%3D%20KEYS%5B1%5D%20%20--%20%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98Key%5Cnlocal%20user_key%20%3D%20KEYS%5B2%5D%20%20%20--%20%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80Key%EF%BC%8C%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%5Cnlocal%20stock%20%3D%20tonumber(redis.call('get'%2C%20stock_key))%5Cn%5Cn--%20%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E8%B6%B3%E5%A4%9F%5Cnif%20stock%20%3C%3D%200%20then%5Cnreturn%20-1%20%20--%20%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%5Cnend%5Cn%5Cn--%20%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E8%BF%87%5Cnif%20redis.call('sismember'%2C%20user_key%2C%20ARGV%5B1%5D)%20%3D%3D%201%20then%5Cnreturn%200%20%20--%20%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%5Cnend%5Cn%5Cn--%20%E6%89%A3%E5%87%8F%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%5Cnredis.call('decr'%2C%20stock_key)%5Cn%5Cn--%20%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%5Cnredis.call('sadd'%2C%20user_key%2C%20ARGV%5B1%5D)%5Cn%5Cnreturn%201%20%20--%20%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ck8NL%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"PqKiZ\" id=\"PqKiZ\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf0ff4e6\" id=\"ucf0ff4e6\">Java代码调用Lua脚本</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u5cbcd8de\" id=\"u5cbcd8de\"><span data-lake-id=\"u928516af\" id=\"u928516af\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">在Java中使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7584c671\" id=\"u7584c671\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe05a7f0\" id=\"ufe05a7f0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">Jedis</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u74a82abe\" id=\"u74a82abe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">，Redis客户端调用上述Lua脚本。下面是一个基于</span><code data-lake-id=\"u4b2e3aa7\" id=\"u4b2e3aa7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa86778a\" id=\"uaa86778a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">Jedis</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud8644661\" id=\"ud8644661\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">的示例代码：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22java%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cnimport%20redis.clients.jedis.Jedis%3B%5Cnimport%20redis.clients.jedis.JedisPool%3B%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20class%20SecKillService%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20private%20JedisPool%20jedisPool%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20SecKillService(JedisPool%20jedisPool)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20this.jedisPool%20%3D%20jedisPool%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20public%20boolean%20doSecKill(String%20userId%2C%20String%20productId)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20try%20(Jedis%20jedis%20%3D%20jedisPool.getResource())%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20Lua%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20String%20luaScript%20%3D%20%5C%22local%20stock_key%20%3D%20KEYS%5B1%5D%3B%5C%22%20%2B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22local%20user_key%20%3D%20KEYS%5B2%5D%3B%5C%22%20%2B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22local%20stock%20%3D%20tonumber(redis.call('get'%2C%20stock_key))%3B%5C%22%20%2B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22if%20stock%20%3C%3D%200%20then%20return%20-1%20end%3B%5C%22%20%2B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22if%20redis.call('sismember'%2C%20user_key%2C%20ARGV%5B1%5D)%20%3D%3D%201%20then%20return%200%20end%3B%5C%22%20%2B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22redis.call('decr'%2C%20stock_key)%3B%5C%22%20%2B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22redis.call('sadd'%2C%20user_key%2C%20ARGV%5B1%5D)%3B%5C%22%20%2B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22return%201%3B%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20String%20stockKey%20%3D%20%5C%22product_stock_%5C%22%20%2B%20productId%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20String%20userKey%20%3D%20%5C%22user_seckill_%5C%22%20%2B%20productId%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8CLua%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Object%20result%20%3D%20jedis.eval(luaScript%2C%202%2C%20stockKey%2C%20userKey%2C%20userId)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20(result.equals(1L))%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20System.out.println(%5C%22%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20true%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%20else%20if%20(result.equals(0L))%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20System.out.println(%5C%22%E4%BD%A0%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E8%BF%87%E4%BA%86%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20false%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%20else%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20System.out.println(%5C%22%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20false%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fxu3W%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"UbYPu\" id=\"UbYPu\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5bec47db\" id=\"u5bec47db\">使用场景示例</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ufae1b8fc\" id=\"ufae1b8fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u107e0e40\" id=\"u107e0e40\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">假设我们有一个热销商品的秒杀活动，活动开始时将商品的库存加载到Redis中：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22java%5Cn%5Cnpublic%20void%20preloadStock(String%20productId%2C%20int%20stock)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20try%20(Jedis%20jedis%20%3D%20jedisPool.getResource())%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20String%20stockKey%20%3D%20%5C%22product_stock_%5C%22%20%2B%20productId%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20jedis.set(stockKey%2C%20String.valueOf(stock))%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uYzxz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4b290957\" id=\"u4b290957\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucdc5b64e\" id=\"ucdc5b64e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">在秒杀开始时，用户请求会通过Java代码调用Lua脚本进行库存的校验与扣减操作，保证每个操作是线程安全的。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"Qi3FY\" id=\"Qi3FY\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0d78d40\" id=\"ud0d78d40\">秒杀并发防超卖架构图</span></h1><ol list=\"u09b02faf\"><li fid=\"u1baab1d4\" data-lake-id=\"u70e7ab86\" id=\"u70e7ab86\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F26817902%2F1729293772630-08c7c901-8358-4b4f-baaf-69bf51310c84.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua2206e5f-7779-4570-9155-1026a7f3054%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ubb230fc5-0f15-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A595.2%2C%22height%22%3A620%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A82918%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A744%2C%22originHeight%22%3A775%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E9%A5%AD%E5%9B%9E%22%2C%22x%22%3A235%2C%22y%22%3A601%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0(%E5%90%8E%E7%AB%AF%E4%BA%8B%E5%8A%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A95%2C%22y%22%3A512%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NGINX%E8%B4%9F%E8%BD%BD%E5%9D%87%E8%A1%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A242%2C%22y%22%3A224%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REDIS%2BLUA%E5%8E%9F%E5%AD%90%E6%89%A3%E5%87%8F%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A216%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9D%80%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%2C%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%22%2C%22x%22%3A336%2C%22y%22%3A511%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%A7%92%E6%9D%80%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A250%2C%22y%22%3A133%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%98%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E8%B6%B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A259%2C%22y%22%3A406%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A270%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A271%2C%22y%22%3A692%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A7%BB2%22%2C%22x%22%3A264%2C%22y%22%3A423%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A7%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%99%BE%22%2C%22x%22%3A379%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfcfc%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u83d6d290%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></li></ol><h1 data-lake-id=\"jnjBn\" id=\"jnjBn\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a763248\" id=\"u8a763248\">优化建议</span></h1><ol list=\"u6e05b16e\"><li fid=\"u9819db47\" data-lake-id=\"u4b208c52\" id=\"u4b208c52\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc989fbb1\" id=\"uc989fbb1\">提前预热库存</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc875c920\" id=\"uc875c920\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：将热门商品的库存提前放入Redis，减轻数据库压力。</span></li><li fid=\"u9819db47\" data-lake-id=\"u40c1cdda\" id=\"u40c1cdda\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u798897a4\" id=\"u798897a4\">使用消息队列</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua328e3c8\" id=\"ua328e3c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：将秒杀成功的订单异步写入数据库，通过消息队列缓解数据库压力。</span></li><li fid=\"u9819db47\" data-lake-id=\"ua9c1e913\" id=\"ua9c1e913\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf18f7748\" id=\"uf18f7748\">限流与降级</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub5187731\" id=\"ub5187731\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：为秒杀活动设置限流策略，防止过多请求涌入影响整体系统。</span></li></ol><h1 data-lake-id=\"CzMp2\" id=\"CzMp2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8f0d3d8d\" id=\"u8f0d3d8d\">总结</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"f7jgc\" id=\"f7jgc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue8b09607\" id=\"ue8b09607\">1. 原理与执行方式</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"GJs8K\" id=\"GJs8K\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0618cb2a\" id=\"u0618cb2a\">Lua脚本</span></h3><ul list=\"u986bd199\"><li fid=\"u783175a6\" data-lake-id=\"u702990da\" id=\"u702990da\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1277b2e0\" id=\"u1277b2e0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">原子性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4fcaef18\" id=\"u4fcaef18\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：Lua脚本在Redis中执行是原子的，意味着整个脚本的执行不会被中断。即使多个请求几乎同时到达，Redis会逐个处理每个脚本的执行。</span></li><li fid=\"u783175a6\" data-lake-id=\"u54502d42\" id=\"u54502d42\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u17c27de5\" id=\"u17c27de5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">单线程处理</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u204646a7\" id=\"u204646a7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：Redis是单线程的，所有的请求都会按顺序处理，确保在执行Lua脚本时不会出现数据竞态条件</span><span data-lake-id=\"u587b9da4\" id=\"u587b9da4\">。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"gSqBh\" id=\"gSqBh\"><span data-lake-id=\"u847e35ae\" id=\"u847e35ae\">加锁</span></h3><ul list=\"u1cd619e0\"><li fid=\"u4d9f0750\" data-lake-id=\"uccb46818\" id=\"uccb46818\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc9c0d0db\" id=\"uc9c0d0db\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">锁机制</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u02eb160f\" id=\"u02eb160f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：加锁是一种控制并发访问的机制。使用锁的目的是在某个时间点，只允许一个线程或进程访问特定资源（如数据库记录）。</span></li><li fid=\"u4d9f0750\" data-lake-id=\"ub4bb707a\" id=\"ub4bb707a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u30220ea8\" id=\"u30220ea8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">可能导致阻塞</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8a2b25f1\" id=\"u8a2b25f1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：在高并发情况下，多个线程可能会等待同一个锁释放，这可能导致性能瓶颈和资源浪费</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub64b0ac9\" id=\"ub64b0ac9\">。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"f7NU0\" id=\"f7NU0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3883704c\" id=\"u3883704c\">2. 性能与效率</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"VddD9\" id=\"VddD9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u367a5f15\" id=\"u367a5f15\">Lua脚本</span></h3><ul list=\"uee8cac73\"><li fid=\"u7eeab103\" data-lake-id=\"u73a57dcb\" id=\"u73a57dcb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u52e94567\" id=\"u52e94567\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">高性能</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5ac00078\" id=\"u5ac00078\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：Lua脚本在Redis中执行的速度非常快，因为Redis是内存数据库，并且Lua脚本避免了多次网络往返。</span></li><li fid=\"u7eeab103\" data-lake-id=\"u6e5945a5\" id=\"u6e5945a5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9d8ab129\" id=\"u9d8ab129\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">没有锁的开销</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5080fadc\" id=\"u5080fadc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：由于脚本是原子执行的，没有额外的锁机制开销，减少了上下文切换和锁竞争</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua423eea7\" id=\"ua423eea7\">。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"O40mp\" id=\"O40mp\"><span data-lake-id=\"u023c0f85\" id=\"u023c0f85\">加锁</span></h3><ul list=\"u22c7c160\"><li fid=\"uba86aca3\" data-lake-id=\"uac22b6db\" id=\"uac22b6db\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0a9f4a11\" id=\"u0a9f4a11\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">性能损耗</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4cc44587\" id=\"u4cc44587\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：在高并发场景中，加锁会引入额外的开销，如获取和释放锁的时间、可能的上下文切换等。</span></li><li fid=\"uba86aca3\" data-lake-id=\"u14dc3b36\" id=\"u14dc3b36\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueb82ee6e\" id=\"ueb82ee6e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">可能造成死锁</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1d80f682\" id=\"u1d80f682\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：如果没有合理管理，加锁可能导致死锁或饥饿状态（某些线程长期无法获取锁）。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"E5TzP\" id=\"E5TzP\"><span data-lake-id=\"uebff8ea8\" id=\"uebff8ea8\">3. 适用场景</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"Xmsal\" id=\"Xmsal\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b800b50\" id=\"u5b800b50\">Lua脚本</span></h3><ul list=\"u0896e117\"><li fid=\"ue7c3bc33\" data-lake-id=\"u95a628f2\" id=\"u95a628f2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud54dd50d\" id=\"ud54dd50d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">高并发的场景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0c4685ec\" id=\"u0c4685ec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：非常适合秒杀、抢购等需要原子性操作的高并发场景。</span></li><li fid=\"ue7c3bc33\" data-lake-id=\"u88d8b5bc\" id=\"u88d8b5bc\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uab71042a\" id=\"uab71042a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">简单的业务逻辑</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u553e06f3\" id=\"u553e06f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：适用于需要在单个操作中完成的简单业务逻辑，如库存检查、更新等。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"jWO7T\" id=\"jWO7T\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ce3638f\" id=\"u9ce3638f\">加锁</span></h3><ul list=\"u448d39b7\"><li fid=\"u01c95b55\" data-lake-id=\"ucd2e1a96\" id=\"ucd2e1a96\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7e292460\" id=\"u7e292460\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">复杂的业务逻辑</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u43777ef7\" id=\"u43777ef7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：适合需要多个步骤的复杂业务逻辑，或者需要在多个服务之间协调的场景。</span></li><li fid=\"u01c95b55\" data-lake-id=\"u746f5468\" id=\"u746f5468\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub91e3d98\" id=\"ub91e3d98\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">需要跨系统协调</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uef7cf9bf\" id=\"uef7cf9bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">：如果操作涉及多个服务或系统，并且需要在整个分布式系统中保持一致性，加锁可能更合适</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud429b497\" id=\"ud429b497\">。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ubc5323b7\" id=\"ubc5323b7\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf418132a\" id=\"uf418132a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u401c04b8\" id=\"u401c04b8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-16\">这种方案通过Redis和Lua实现了高效的库存操作，确保了库存的准确性和并发情况下的线程安全。在秒杀活动中，减少了超卖的风险，提升了系统的可靠性。</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1452, "description": "方案分析在高并发秒杀场景下，库存超卖的主要原因是：多个并发请求同时操作库存，导致库存变负或超卖。数据库性能瓶颈无法快速响应大量请求。Redis+Lua解决方案Redis是单线程的，结合Lua脚本可以保证对库存的操作是原子的，避免并发问题。Redis的优势：高并发、高性能、支持丰富的数据结构。L...", "updated_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:17.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:38:59.000Z", "id": 216261293, "status": 1}